tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Red Ghost.png\">Red Ghost.png</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Red Ghost.png\">Red Ghost.png</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>Red Ghost\n</td>\n<td>750\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Blue Ghost.png\">Blue Ghost.png</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Blue Ghost.png\">Blue Ghost.png</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>Blue Ghost\n</td>\n<td>1200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: PurpleGhost\">PurpleGhost</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: PurpleGhost\">PurpleGhost</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</th>\n<th>Purple Ghost\n</th>\n<th>4800\n</th></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>When it becomes night, White Ghosts are easier to find than any other.</li>\n<li>Have a total of 5 faces that are randomized but do not give any other effects.</li></ul>\n\n</div>"}
